  - title: What would you do?
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - You're a grown-up but you don't count, because you're a farmer. So you can tell me.
    - 'The fair: Bea says my chart could make the city newspaper. People might finally look at the river.'
    - 'The final: the team needs a keeper, and it''s against the city team in the Sterling shirts, and I really, REALLY want to beat them.'
    - Which one?
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: The science fair
      replyA:
      - The fair. Yeah. For the beetles. For Gregory's cousins.
      - I'm going to make the BEST poster. With glitter. Science can have glitter.
      flagsA:
      - nia_science_fair
      optionB: The cup final
      replyB:
      - The final! YES! I'm going to save EVERYTHING.
      - Bea says she'll take my chart to the fair for me anyway. So I get both! Kind of! Half of both!
      flagsB:
      - nia_cup_final
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: First prize
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I WON. First prize! A gold ribbon and a book about beetles that weighs more than Gregory's whole house.
    - 'And a man from the city newspaper took my picture. Tomorrow it says: ''9-year-old finds poison in river.'''
    - Dad bought ten copies. Mum read it out loud three times. And the team won the final without me, five-four, so nobody's even sad.
    happy: 1
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
